  m_text: "Non-Alcoholic Menu\nM1. Mimocka (Chilled Martini glass): Ice, ginger beer,
    orange juice, orange slice\nM2. Mockdriver (Whiskey glass): ginger beer, orange
    juice\nM3. Mocktail Mule (Copper Mug): Ice, ginger beer, lime juice, lime slice,
    mint\n \nFrozen Cocktails\nF1. Frozen Daiquiri (Martini glass): Sugar, slush,
    rum, lime slice\nF2. Frozen Margarita (Martini glass): Salt, slush, tequila,
    triple sec, lime juice, lime slice\nF3. Frozen Screwdriver (Whiskey glass): Slush,
    vodka, orange juice\n\nBurning Drinks\nP1. Blow My Flaming Skull (Whiskey glass):
    Caramelized sugar, Beer, Rum, Pyrotechnics\nP2. Hot Shot (Whiskey glass): Tequila,
    Flaming Shot"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
