    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[0].reminderDialogue
      value: 'Look at me and press [SPACE] to continue. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[1].reminderDialogue
      value: <color=blue>Click the Beer Mugs, kid.</color>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[2].reminderDialogue
      value: Pick up a <color=red>Beer Mug, put it in the Beer Tap</color>, and <color=blue>Click
        me.</color>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[3].reminderDialogue
      value: Fill the Mug with Beer, pick up the Mug, and <color=blue>serve it by
        releasing it on me.</color>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[4].reminderDialogue
      value: Look at the Bottles in front of you to see the Shortcut. <color=blue>Serve
        me Rum in a Whiskey Glass</color>.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[5].reminderDialogue
      value: Click on the Screen to continue
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[6].reminderDialogue
      value: <color=blue>Beer and Rum in a Whiskey Glass</color>, makes my head go
        boom.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[7].reminderDialogue
      value: Click me to continue.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[8].reminderDialogue
      value: Click me to continue.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[9].reminderDialogue
      value: Click me to continue.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[10].reminderDialogue
      value: Click the Poison Ampoule to Continue, kid.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[11].reminderDialogue
      value: Look at the Poison Ampoule to see its Shortcut, and serve me a Blow
        My Skull with Poison.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[12].reminderDialogue
      value: Click me so we can wrap this up, and you can start working.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[13].reminderDialogue
      value: Click me so we can wrap this up, and you can start working.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
